{"version":1,"content":"<p>索尼互動娛樂申請了一項弧形頸戴式設備專利，計劃通過可控氣流增強虛擬現實體驗。專利示意圖顯示，玩家可同時佩戴該裝置與VR頭顯，設備能夠向頸部、下巴或面部送風。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586780.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.698171+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:19:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:10.776494+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:10.776494+00:00","content_hash":"9861531d4c279b9d235db8aa2d3943e26c264caeaa209d283b27b8b5bfe69e1f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}